cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "quant-system: a one-person research programme on crypto perpetual-futures microstructure"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Beardo Campo"
    given-names: "Manuel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Lostmanu/quant-system"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-09-22"
abstract: >-
  The laboratory of a research programme that ran from June to September 2026 and found no trading
  edge in crypto perpetual futures. It contains the code that survived the final cleanup, its tests,
  six checks that run in continuous integration, and the written record of the programme.
keywords:
  - market microstructure
  - cryptocurrency
  - negative results
  - mutation testing
  - research engineering
